        Target SNOMED CT 4289331, concept_code 69129000. Best available standard concept: W26.8 and W26.9
        both crosswalk to 4289331 in the Athena mirror, and these Swedish extensions further subdivide
        that space by activity. Broader: target subsumes source without capturing the activity/place
        axis. Moderate tier: crosswalk via the.8 subparent, unspecified-source breadth mismatch, not
        independently re-verified.
        """
}
